    "qa:Q6345": {"card_ids": ["BT25-058"], "gating": true, "kind": "positive", "q_id": "Q6345", "semantic_fingerprint_version": 1, "semantic_payload": ["digimon-qa-semantics", 1, "Q6345", ["BT25-058"], "positive", "Can this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] [When Attacking] effect suspend a different card from the one that's given \"can't unsuspend until their turn ends?\nYes, it can."], "semantic_sha256": "cc542482c5a8b5c69e455224b01bafbeea1bdb9a5af986e25fe19000288b3153", "source": "qa", "text_sha256": "43438851af3b9304b9f6b33456ad4fc035f68c1264d38aa9732e6c9bf9f2ab0a"},
    "qa:Q6346": {"card_ids": ["BT25-058"], "gating": true, "kind": "positive", "q_id": "Q6346", "semantic_fingerprint_version": 1, "semantic_payload": ["digimon-qa-semantics", 1, "Q6346", ["BT25-058"], "positive", "Does this card's [All Turns] effect also trigger when this card itself is played by an effect or when one of my Digimon in the battle area would digivolve into this card by an effect?\nYes, it triggers."], "semantic_sha256": "154221a4cb050d5412174625676622177d65b9014972a16e4da2462530ba79ab", "source": "qa", "text_sha256": "9656cbd97d2977ada50729af4189d6c54fa32dd9118f0af16306686527237d1a"},
    "qa:Q6347": {"card_ids": ["BT25-058"], "gating": true, "kind": "positive", "q_id": "Q6347", "semantic_fingerprint_version": 1, "semantic_payload": ["digimon-qa-semantics", 1, "Q6347", ["BT25-058"], "positive", "If this card's [All Turns] effect triggers, do I have to process \" 1 of your opponent's Digimon\"?\nYes, you have to process it. However, \"then, this Digimon and 1 of your opponent's Digimon may battle\" is optional and you may choose whether or not to process it."], "semantic_sha256": "1f21bad60d68923034dc7dcc10dedbe03e099f3172e8321bbfe1ac965d445e5b", "source": "qa", "text_sha256": "09344ca9af156b8ed69df03292b06d26bf538a5dd777d31a5157e65a701b466a"},
    "qa:Q6348": {"card_ids": ["BT25-058"], "gating": true, "kind": "positive", "q_id": "Q6348", "semantic_fingerprint_version": 1, "semantic_payload": ["digimon-qa-semantics", 1, "Q6348", ["BT25-058"], "positive", "What does \"may battle\" mean, exactly?\nThis effect directly performs a battle. If this effect is activated, the chosen Digimon battle, as with the standard rules."], "semantic_sha256": "e182a9d48d6b04e11571be5a81eaecb6e183c95c58c9e711a18a843b1d2d7e8e", "source": "qa", "text_sha256": "71ee07416869c912ef078f6531945bf2a18cef0655b921730d13ba65a5ad3ac1"},
    "qa:Q6349": {"card_ids": ["BT25-058"], "gating": true, "kind": "positive", "q_id": "Q6349", "semantic_fingerprint_version": 1, "semantic_payload": ["digimon-qa-semantics", 1, "Q6349", ["BT25-058"], "positive", "If 2 Digimon including a Digimon that has an \"effects don't affect\" effect are chosen for a \"may battle\" effect, can those Digimon battle?\nYes, they can battle. A card that has an \"effects don't affect\" effect can still be chosen for an effect. In addition, a battle itself is a rule that compares DP, not an effect. Therefore, a Digimon that isn't affected by effects can be chosen, and then it can battle. If it loses the battle, it will be deleted as normal according to the rules."], "semantic_sha256": "e5d4d3e81e3e08395a6ff85ae026783e79fb51c7f3882fe5af8ffabd10dd100e", "source": "qa", "text_sha256": "949f6c86fab273ded86246e82f75d9e5333b9c0945120085673beea384f43359"}
